# Local working clones of the standalone project repos.
# Each is its own git repository (see AGENTS.md §8). They live outside this
# repo, in ~/dev/clones — outside the Google Drive/Insync tree this workspace
# sits in — and are symlinked in for visibility. These patterns deliberately
# have NO trailing slash: a trailing slash matches directories only, so the
# symlinks would fall through and `git add .` would commit machine-specific
# absolute paths.
/chromacalm
/softcontrast
/focusbeacon
/terminal-a11y
/glaremap
/temporalsafe
/keratoscope
